OL,3,A'We want to be heard, not teargassed':
OL,4,AStudents joined by parents and unions
OL,5,Ain mass French protests
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government says 715 police officers
OL,8,Fhave also been injured since the
OL,9,Fprotests started in Paris in late
OL,10,FSeptember
OL,12,FOn Tuesday, teenage students stood on
OL,13,Fbarricades outside schools from Lille
OL,14,Fin the north to Marseille in the south
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
